# Project: openOODA Installation & Governance Adversarial Audit

## Architecture
The openOODA ecosystem spans three coordinated tiers:
1. **Tier 1 (Ecosystem & Governance)**: `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA` — Architecture boards, 10 governance pillars (`enforcer.oo`), process board verifiers (`check_board.oo`, `verify_all.oo`), 8 red-team challenger gates + 9th structural integrity gate (`redteam_hook.oo`), break-test harnesses (`install_redteam_breaktest.oo`).
2. **Tier 2 (Toolchain & Runtime Engine)**: `/home/jeryd/Projects/ooda` — Compiler, native toolchain, LSP, MCP server, runtime distribution tarballs and sidecars (`ooda/dist/`).
3. **Tier 3 (Web Ingestion & Deployment Scripts)**: `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA.github.io` — Universal deployment scripts (`install.sh`, `install.ps1` in root and `install/`), cryptographic key distribution (`openooda.pub`), website assets.

